      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作法.",
        "1) $(N_1P_1)=(NPD)\\cap(ABC)$；",
        "2) $K=(N_1P_1)\\cap(NP)$（对于$(NP)\\nparallel(ABC)$的情形，图",
        "55，а）；",
        "3) $(KM)=\\alpha\\cap(ABC)$，$[EF]=\\alpha\\cap\\triangle ABC$. ",
        "如果$(NP)\\parallel(ABC)$，那么$[FE]\\parallel[NP]$（图55，б）；",
        "4) $(EN)=\\alpha\\cap(ABD)$，$[EH]=\\alpha\\cap\\triangle ABD$；",
        "5) $(FP)=\\alpha\\cap(ACD)$，$[FG]=\\alpha\\cap\\triangle ACD$. ",
        "截面$EFGH$满足问题的条件.",
        "研究. 问题有唯一解（公理4）. 截面可能是四边形（图",
        "55а，б）或者是三角形（图55，в）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "134",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$134^*$. 作四面体$ABCD$的截面，截平面$MNP$中，$M$",
        "$\\in\\triangle ADC$，$N\\in\\triangle BDC$，$P\\in[AB]$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "135",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "135. 1) 已知：$\\alpha\\parallel\\beta$. “在平面$\\alpha$内可以作两条直线分",
        "别平行于$\\beta$内两条相交直线”，这个论断正确吗？",
        "2) 利用1) 中的结果，说出两个平面平行的充分必要条",
        "件."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "136",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "136. 如果：1) 和平面$\\alpha$相交的某一条直线和平面$\\beta$平",
        "行；2) 在平面$\\alpha$内的任意的直线和$\\beta$平行，$\\alpha$和$\\beta$的位置关",
        "系可能是怎样的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "137",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$137^{\\circ}$. 已知：$a\\subset\\alpha$，$a\\parallel\\beta$. 结论$\\alpha\\parallel\\beta$正确吗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "138",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "138. 已知：$\\alpha\\parallel\\beta$，$a\\parallel\\alpha$. 证明：$a\\parallel\\beta$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "139",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "139. 已知：$\\alpha\\parallel\\beta$（$\\alpha\\ne\\beta$），$\\{A,C\\}\\subset\\alpha$，$\\{B,D\\}\\subset\\beta$，$[AB]↵\\cap[CD]=M$. 证明：$(AC)\\parallel(BD)$."
      ]
    },
